5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the ground will surprise us. Let’s check who can actually dig here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The park is crossed and drained weekly. I need to see how people actually move through it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m curious who looks after this place. The rota feels too short for new work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I want to see what our last decade of schemes looks like now, not just the drawings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m concerned about the long-term cost. What will this place cost the city to keep?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, movement is key. If the ground is soft, people won’t cross. Let’s verify the paths.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, agreed. But I also need to know if the drainage holds up. Let’s check the callouts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, I agree. Past work tells the truth. I’ll look at the volunteer groups too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, volunteers help, but I need hard data on what survived. I’ll check the condition of works.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, condition is vital. But I need to know the upkeep cost per hectare.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will review the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m ready to see what the ground really allows. Let’s hope the firms are reliable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The data will show if the plan fights the reality of the site.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I’m hoping the volunteers can help. Let’s see who is actually there.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,The past is the only honest witness. I will review my findings before we vote.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The numbers will reveal the truth of our capacity. I look forward to our findings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
