60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"The candidates are A: Wetland, B: Market, C: Woodland, D: Sports. A fits the fund and phasing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A addresses the drainage. B and D need hard surfacing, which the fund won’t pay for. C needs aftercare we can’t provide.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,A uses the volunteers’ habitat skills. B and D need more staff than we have. C is too risky with the tree deaths.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,A is the only one that survived the fund check. B and D are financially impossible. C is a repeat of the avenue failure.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,A is the only one the fund supports. B and D are out. C is a cost trap. A is the logical choice.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, exactly. The fund terms kill B and D. A is the only one that fits the money and the ground.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, agreed. The drainage data supports A. It’s the only plan that improves the site’s function.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, I agree. The volunteers can help with A. It’s the safest bet for the people who run the park.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, yes. The past data shows A is the only one that doesn’t repeat our mistakes. I’m confident in A.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, the cost is high, but it’s the only one we can afford to start. A is the prudent choice.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I vote for A. It respects the ground, the fund, and the phasing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for A. It solves the drainage problem and fits the site’s reality.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I vote for A. The volunteers can help, and it’s the least risky for the staff.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for A. It’s the only plan that aligns with the fund and avoids past failures.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for A. It’s the only financially viable option given the fund terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,We all agree. A is the best choice. Let’s proceed with Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The data is unanimous. A is the only rational choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I’m happy we all agree. A is the best choice for the park and the people.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,The evidence is clear. A is the only choice supported by the data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,The numbers support A. It is the enduring path. Let us commit to the work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
